# The servos hang as the robot's do (2026-10-28: ~8 % of the rail switch-ons; the hardware stays as it is): both stop
# taking packets at a switch-on until the rail goes off. Midday alone, as day_alone. The watchdog (ServoSupervisor)
# and the power-gated moves must keep the head alive; the robot's mood and voice must not suffer.
duration 20:00
clock 12:00
seed 6
window 170 20 40 30
lamp desk 100 12 on
at 0:00 fault servo 0.08
